                 plates, white small text lifted to BOTTOM+6) and AddOns wears the unselected
                 one (Options_Tab_* plates, gold small text at BOTTOM+4 — era's unselected
                 look, per the director's capture; the button is still dead). The three-slice:
                 Left/Right caps BOTTOM-anchored at atlas size (7x26 active / 7x23 not, so the
                 selected plate stands 3 taller), Middle (a 1px column) stretched between. The
                 era's width law is text + 40, measured at OnLoad with the MEDIUM font before
                 the small font lands (MinimalTab.lua l.7-9, the quirk kept verbatim) — our
                 measure round-trip answers a frame late, so OnUpdate polls until the width is
